}

title Formal-first libvgraph delivery

start
:Define terms and observable semantics; <<#DBEAFE>>
:Prove quotient and wavefront laws in Rocq; <<#C4B5FD>>
:Prove work, heap, and native-control bounds; <<#DDD6FE>>
:Model explicit-frame lifecycle and work in TLA+; <<#A7F3D0>>
:Run exhaustive independent graph and cost oracle; <<#FDE68A>>
if (All semantic gates pass?) then (yes)
  :Implement canonical CSR and iterative SCC kernel; <<#BFDBFE>>
  :Prove arithmetic refinement in Verus; <<#DDD6FE>>
  :Bound-check production operations with Kani; <<#C4B5FD>>
  :Check implementation refinement and small-stack behavior; <<#A7F3D0>>
  :Run vinary-doc-lint and release gates; <<#FBCFE8>>
  stop
else (no)
  :Correct the specification or rejected design; <<#FECACA>>
  :Repeat proofs and models; <<#C4B5FD>>
  stop
endif
@enduml
